    [02] <nested_tools>
        Nested tools, each called inside `exec` by its `tools` member:
        - clock.curr_time (tools.clock__curr_time): Return the current time in UTC.
        - clock.sleep (tools.clock__sleep): Pause execution for a specified duration.
        - tools.fs: Filesystem transport for the fs.readFile/fs.writeFile JS helpers.
        - tools.retire_agent: Retire a stopped descendant and its stopped descendants from the persistent family roster.
        - tools.set_agent_service_tier: Change a descendant agent's routing tier without interrupting it, sending a message, or starting a turn.
        - tools.update_work_status: Set `activity` to show what you are working on, without posting a chat message.
        - tools.view_image: View a local image file from the filesystem when visual inspection is needed.
        - tools.write_stdin: Writes characters to an existing unified exec session and returns recent output.
        - wrangler_agents.followup_task (tools.wrangler_agents__followup_task): Send a follow-up task to an exis...n-root target agent and trigger a turn if it is idle. [hash=474c3519e27ad661]
        - wrangler_agents.interrupt_agent (tools.wrangler_agents__interrupt_agent): Interrupt an agent's current turn, if any, and return its previous status.
        - wrangler_agents.list_agents (tools.wrangler_agents__list_agents): List retained agents in the current ...tree, including unloaded agents (agent_status: null). [hash=e7c3805d318aabbc]
        - wrangler_agents.send_message (tools.wrangler_agents__send_message): Send a message to an existing agent.
        - wrangler_agents.spawn_agent (tools.wrangler_agents__spawn_agent): Spawns an agent to work on the specified task.
        </nested_tools>
